OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is City of Culture and what
OL,4,Adoes winning it mean?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlackpool has been shortlisted for the
OL,7,F2029 UK City of Culture, but what would
OL,8,Fit mean for the town to win?.
OL,10,FThe UK City of Culture competition is
OL,11,Frun by the government every four years
OL,12,Fto celebrate the "enormous
OL,13,Fcontributions" made by communities
OL,14,Facross the UK.
OL,16,FBlackpool made the top nine, and then
OL,17,Fthe top four alongside Milton Keynes,
OL,18,FSheffield and Wrexham and the town is
OL,19,Fin the running to become the fifth
OL,20,Fholder of the title.
